# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dropped 2 August 2026 on James's instruction: the board-shared ("General")
# arcade layer and the 87 placeholder curricula behind it.
#
# Those 87 curriculum files declare in their own source_note: "AI-generated
# representative sample for review - not an official exam-board specification".
# Nothing that maps only to them can claim to be spec-aligned, so rather than
# keep content of uncertain spec-relevance it is removed, to be rebuilt properly.
#
# 974 arcade shelves, 11,552 banks, 1,536 adventure pages, 87 curricula.
# No mini-lesson and no sitemapped URL is affected - these carried only
# adventure pages, which were already noindex,nofollow. Nothing 404s.
#
# The files remain on disk (the device bridge cannot delete); they are simply
# no longer part of the published site.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
